q BT 65.20 771.39 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (He planted roses for the boss for thirty years. Then he planted something else.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 741.91 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.095 Tw (Silas Grant was sixty-eight years old, and his hands were the color of the soil he worked. For) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 721.50 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.118 Tw (thirty years he had tended the gardens of the Ferraro estate, ten acres of lawn and hedges and) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 701.09 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.100 Tw (rose beds behind a wall that kept the world out and the family's secrets in. He had been hired) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 680.68 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.446 Tw (when the old Don's father still ran the house, and he had stayed through three generations of) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 660.27 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 2.427 Tw (Ferraros, because Silas understood the one rule of working for a powerful family: you see) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 639.86 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (nothing, you hear nothing, and you keep the roses alive.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 610.38 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.405 Tw (The roses were the finest in the state. People said so at parties, and the Don liked hearing it.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 589.98 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.106 Tw (What people did not know was that Silas grew them in soil he mixed himself, and that the oldest) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 569.57 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (rose bed, the one beneath the south wall, held something no gardener should ever have to bury.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 540.09 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.452 Tw (His daughter, June, had been twenty-four when she died. The official story was an overdose.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 519.68 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.365 Tw (The real story was a shipment, a deal, and a family that sold poison by the kilo and called it) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 499.27 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.933 Tw (business. Silas had held her hand in the hospital while the machines slowed down, and he had) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 478.86 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.056 Tw (listened to a young doctor explain, in careful words, that the drugs in her system had a signature.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 458.45 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.489 Tw (A signature the police already knew. A signature that led to one family, and one name, and one) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 438.04 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (house with beautiful roses.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 408.56 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.218 Tw (Silas did not go to the police. A man who has worked thirty years behind a wall knows what) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 388.15 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (happens to people who talk. Instead, he did what gardeners do. He dug.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 358.67 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.269 Tw (It took him four years to build his garden of evidence. He was the family's bookkeeper's best) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 338.26 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.704 Tw (friend, an old man named Petey who drank too much and talked too much and trusted Silas) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 317.85 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.768 Tw (because Silas had once driven him home in a storm. Petey gave him copies. Ledgers. Dates. A) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 297.44 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.606 Tw (tape recording, made on a machine older than June, of the Don himself giving an order in a) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 277.03 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.811 Tw (voice like gravel. Silas put it all in a waterproof steel box, wrapped it in oilcloth, and buried it) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 256.62 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.511 Tw (two feet deep beneath the oldest rose bed, under a variety called Peace. He planted a marker he) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 236.21 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (would never forget: a white rose, the only white rose in the whole garden.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 206.73 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.310 Tw (For twenty-six years, the box slept under the roses. Silas watered it. He pruned around it. He) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 186.32 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (never told a soul.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 156.84 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.547 Tw (Then the old Don died, and his son Marco inherited the estate, and Marco had no sentiment for) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 136.43 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.155 Tw (gardens. Marco wanted the land sold. Developers wanted the wall down and the roses gone. The) Tj ET Q
