q BT 65.20 95.61 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (come the week after.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 66.13 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (Silas had one week, and he had a decision to make.) Tj ET Q
