q BT 65.20 771.39 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.997 Tw (He could dig the box up himself, carry it to the FBI office downtown, and end the Ferraro) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 750.98 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.144 Tw (family with his own two hands. He was sixty-eight years old. He had nothing left to lose. But he) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 730.57 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.243 Tw (also knew that the moment the box left the ground, he would be a dead man, and that the family) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 710.16 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (had long arms.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 680.68 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.155 Tw (Or he could do nothing. Let the diggers find it. Let the sale collapse in scandal. Let the truth rise) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 660.27 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.224 Tw (out of the ground on its own, the way Silas had always known it would, sooner or later. But that) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 639.86 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (meant trusting strangers, and trusting strangers had never saved anyone in his life.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 610.38 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.039 Tw (On Wednesday night, Silas walked the garden one last time. He stopped at the white rose. He) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 589.98 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.346 Tw (knelt, the way he had knelt a thousand times to tend the soil, and he put his hand flat on the) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 569.57 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.252 Tw (earth above the box. He thought about June. He thought about thirty years of roses. And then he) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 549.16 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (heard footsteps on the gravel behind him.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 519.68 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (It was Marco Ferraro.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 490.20 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.299 Tw (The young Don stood there in the dark in a suit that cost more than Silas made in a year, and he) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 469.79 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (looked at the old gardener kneeling in the dirt, and he said, "I know what is under there, Silas.") Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 440.31 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (Silas did not move. His heart hammered against his ribs.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 410.83 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.488 Tw ("My father told me," Marco said. "Years ago. He said the gardener was the only honest man he) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 390.42 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.699 Tw (ever knew, and that if the family ever needed to end, it would end in the garden. He said to let) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 370.01 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (you decide.") Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 340.53 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (Marco knelt beside him. He put his own hand on the earth.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 311.05 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.346 Tw ("Dig it up," Marco said quietly. "I am tired of being afraid of my own name. Take it to the FBI.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 290.64 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (I will drive you there myself.") Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 261.16 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.498 Tw (Silas stared at him. In thirty years, no Ferraro had ever asked him for anything except roses.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 240.75 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (Now this one was asking him to destroy them.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 211.27 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg ("Why?" Silas asked.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 181.79 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.838 Tw ("Because my father built an empire on poison," Marco said, "and my sister died of it too. You) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 161.38 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (didn't know that. Her name was Ana. She was seventeen.") Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 131.90 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.928 Tw (They dug together, in the dark, with their hands. The box came up out of the earth like a seed) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 111.49 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.184 Tw (that had finally sprouted. Marco drove Silas to the federal building himself, and he waited in the) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 91.08 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (car while Silas carried the box inside, and when Silas came back out, Marco was still there.) Tj ET Q
